  "description": "With specialisations in women’s health, musculoskeletal disorders, mental health promotion, sports health, TCM support for transition and hormone therapy, and burnout, I guide my patients individually on their path to greater balance and well-being. For over 30 years, I have passionately guided people on their path to greater health and well-being. I deepened my thorough training in Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) through study stays in China. I have successfully applied my knowledge in emergency situations as well as in general medical contexts.",
